                  %a{:href => "#double_negation"} Relation to double-negation topology
                %li
                  %a{:href => "#the_denseclosedfactorization"} The (dense,closed)-factorization
                %li
                  %a{:href => "#parallels_topology"} Some parallels to topology
                %li
